# MAGIC ### B4. Databricks AI Platform
# MAGIC
# MAGIC Finally, the Databricks AI Platform brings together the tools needed to build, deploy, monitor, and govern machine learning and AI applications across the lifecycle. Unity Catalog provides centralized discovery, access control, lineage, and governance for data, features, models, and functions. With Feature Engineering in Unity Catalog, teams can manage features as governed data assets; MLflow tracks experiments and the model lifecycle; Model Serving deploys models; and built-in monitoring helps identify data-quality issues, model drift, and changes in production performance. Together, these capabilities connect raw data, feature engineering, model development, deployment, and monitoring on one platform.
