# MAGIC <div class="w"><h4>&#8635; Reusability &amp; discoverability</h4><p>Feature lineage (data sources + code versions) is tracked automatically, enabling lineage-based search. MLflow also records which models consume which features, so updates and deletions stay safe.</p></div>
# MAGIC <div class="w"><h4>&#9878; No online/offline skew</h4><p>Feature-lookup logic is packaged with the model via MLflow, so the exact same features are used in training and serving &mdash; no client changes, no skew.</p></div>
